  _ControlsText: '<b>Mouse & Keyboard</b>

    Left click rune: drag  |  Left click
    field: pan

    Middle mouse: pan  |  WASD: move

    Scroll or [ ]: zoom  | 
    Esc: back  |  Tab: side panel

    Drag from the list to place, onto the list
    to remove


    <b>Gamepad</b>

    Left stick: move  |  Right stick: free cursor

    LT
    / RT: zoom  |  A: pick up / drop

    X: send rune back  |  B: back  |  Y: side
    panel

    Hold A on the list to drag a rune out'
